# .containerignore — keep the build context tight.
# Anything NOT needed inside the image (or already provided by a stage) is
# listed here. Podman / Buildah honor this file alongside .dockerignore.
#
# Note: AGENTS.md §3 — docs are Korean-language documentation, not runtime
# assets; they are excluded so a doc-only edit does not invalidate the
# uv-cache layer.

# Local virtualenv + caches. Recreating the env inside the builder is the
# whole point of the uv stage.
.venv
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.pytest_cache
.hypothesis

# VCS metadata, editor swap, OS noise.
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.editorconfig
.DS_Store

# Tests + dev tooling. The image only needs the runtime src/ tree.
tests
pytest.ini
conftest.py
.coverage
htmlcov

# Docs (Korean-language guides) are not part of the runtime image.
docs
*.md
!README.md
!Containerfile
!LICENSE

# Examples + host-side scripts are loaded explicitly via COPY container/...
# but excluding their directories from the *build context*'s auto-include is
# not necessary — the explicit COPYs still win. Listed for clarity only:
# container/examples
# container/systemd
